        {
          "text": "Kodwa lapho iNkosi ekhazimulayo izakuba kithi indawo yemifula ebanzi lemifula; okungayikuhamba khona umkhumbi uphethe izigwedlo, nomkhumbi wamaqhawe awuyikudlula.",
